Z||000000||SteveJ||06-27-2001||04:37 PM||||I have a Microsoft Intellieye mouse that is great. No more dust in the ball problems. No more skipping. Fantastic product.<P>BUT, the model I have has a cheap cord on it. I have the model that looks like a regular wheel mouse but uses the optical mechanism.<P>I dropped it again the other day but caught it by the cord before it hit the ground. It's the second time I have done that and this will be the second time I have to open it and chop off a couple inches of cord.<P>It says IntelliMouse w/IntelliEye 1.0, USB and PS/2 Compatible.||||reg||1
